        <div class="founder__text">
            <p>For twelve years I've built brands, written and made documentaries and commercials for Brands like Red Bull, Commercial Bank, Barista and a long run of travel and hospitality clients. For eight of those years the work was wellness travel. I spent them with Ayurva Traveller, four-time winner of Asia's Leading Wellness Travel Agency at the World Spa Awards, learning how a healing holiday is actually assembled and where it usually fails.</p>
            <p>What I kept seeing bothered me. Sri Lanka has practitioners the world would fly for, and almost nobody telling them properly. Guests arrive but there's no real navigation.</p>
            <p>MĀRGHĀ is my attempt at the alternative. With nearly a decade observing and working directly with Wellness Tourists, Wellness Brands and practitioners, and through my own experience of healing travel, we are curating holidays where you actually HEAL from WITHIN.</p>
            <p class="founder__sig"><strong>-Fiyoni Pinto,</strong> <em>Founder &amp; Managing Director</em></p>
        </div>
